    "JSON nulls from the bool? era (#611) keep the initializers": {
      "Stored": "{\"AutoPauseEnabled\":null,\"ShowResolutionTag\":null,\"QualityTagsEnabled\":null,\"ResolutionTagOrder\":null,\"UseNativePosterTags\":null,\"DisplayLanguage\":\"fr\"}",
